    "steam_appid": 3205610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205610/extras/83eeaaa762adb85bd1953d950f86e36a.avif?t=1730917032\" width=600 height=97 /></span><br><strong>Bleak</strong> is an <strong>innovative</strong> 2D adventure developed with RPG Maker that blends the nostalgic aesthetics of games like <i>Omori</i>, <i>OneShot</i>, and <i>To the Moon</i> with a <i>revolution</i> in <i>gameplay</i>.<br><br><br>You embody <strong>Oshibka</strong>, a man who is <i>dissatisfied</i> and <i>frustrated</i> with his life, who quits his job in search of a <i>change</i>. Unintentionally, he plunges into a world of crime, facing a turbulent journey filled with <strong>crucial decisions</strong>. Every <strong>choice</strong> you make will impact his struggle to escape this dangerous environment and find personal redemption.<br><br><br>It introduces a <strong>real-time battle system</strong> (ABS) that <i>breaks</i> away from the tradition of turn-based combat. Your <strong>skill</strong> and <strong>reflexes</strong> will be crucial for surviving the <i>confrontations</i> that await you. Additionally, the experience is enriched with mechanics inspired by <i>Shakedown: Hawaii</i>, <i>Resident Evil</i>, and the early <i>GTA</i> games.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205610/extras/83eeaaa762adb85bd1953d950f86e36a.avif?t=1730917032\" width=600 height=97 /></span><br><strong>Bleak</strong> is an <strong>innovative</strong> 2D adventure developed with RPG Maker that blends the nostalgic aesthetics of games like <i>Omori</i>, <i>OneShot</i>, and <i>To the Moon</i> with a <i>revolution</i> in <i>gameplay</i>.<br><br><br>You embody <strong>Oshibka</strong>, a man who is <i>dissatisfied</i> and <i>frustrated</i> with his life, who quits his job in search of a <i>change</i>. Unintentionally, he plunges into a world of crime, facing a turbulent journey filled with <strong>crucial decisions</strong>. Every <strong>choice</strong> you make will impact his struggle to escape this dangerous environment and find personal redemption.<br><br><br>It introduces a <strong>real-time battle system</strong> (ABS) that <i>breaks</i> away from the tradition of turn-based combat. Your <strong>skill</strong> and <strong>reflexes</strong> will be crucial for surviving the <i>confrontations</i> that await you. Additionally, the experience is enriched with mechanics inspired by <i>Shakedown: Hawaii</i>, <i>Resident Evil</i>, and the early <i>GTA</i> games.",
    "short_description": "Dissatisfaction and frustration are common feelings in life. You face a path where every choice can bring you closer to or further from the improvement you so desire. Difficult decisions require strong wills.",
